Added a ``plate`` converter that produces the ``__somersault__`` block of Plone Aurora from HTML and Markdown: ``converter="plate"`` in ``html_to_blocks()``, ``markdown_to_blocks()``, ``volto_blocks()`` and the HTTP service, and ``--converter plate`` in the ``convert`` command. Added ``slate_to_plate()``, the ``html2blocks slate2plate`` command and ``POST /slate2plate`` to migrate existing content. ``slate`` stays the default. @ericof
